{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"report_supported\": \"partly\",\n  \"judge_supported\": \"yes\",\n  \"report_quotes\": [\n    \"First, Fisher Exact Statistics on the primary outcome revealed that at six months follow-up, STN-DBS patients were significantly less likely to demonstrate FOG than the BMT-group (Table 2).\",\n    \"After adjustment for baseline differences in LED scores, the interaction effect of group*time was no longer significant (Wald X² = 1.12; p = 0.57).\"\n  ],\n  \"judge_quotes\": [\n    \"After adjustment for baseline differences in LED scores, the interaction effect of group*time was no longer significant (Wald X² = 1.12; p = 0.57).\",\n    \"STN-DBS-induced benefits on FOG were mostly mediated by baseline levodopa equivalent dose, altered medication-intake and reduced motor fluctuations.\",\n    \"Freezer-to-non-freezer conversion at 12 months was significantly correlated with the relative reduction in LED (expressed as percentage of baseline LED, R=0.46, p=0.04) and with the reduction in on/off fluctuations (UPDRS IVb scores, R=0.47, p=0.03), meaning that freezers with a more pronounced reduction in LED and on/off fluctuations at 12 months follow-up have a higher likelihood to have become a non-freezer at this time point.\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"报告的说法部分有依据：原文确实报告了未经基线LED调整的6个月FOG发生率组间差异具有统计学意义（Fisher's Exact，p=0.01），GEE事后比较也报告了6个月组间差异（p=0.04）。但是，原文并非没有呈现LED调整结果，而是明确报告控制基线LED差异后，组别与时间的交互作用不再显著（Wald χ²=1.12，p=0.57）。需要注意，该调整结果针对组别与时间的交互作用，并非单独报告调整后的6个月组间比较值。指控者的核心描述有明确全文依据：原文摘要明确指出STN-DBS对FOG的获益主要由基线LED、药物摄入变化及运动波动减少所介导，结果部分也报告了LED减少与运动波动减少和FOG改善之间的相关性。因此，如果报告只强调未经调整的显著组间差异，而没有交代LED调整后交互作用不再显著这一重要结果，就遗漏了影响结论解释的关键证据，不能据此直接强调独立的刺激效应。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "85a054e3-1469-44e3-87bb-1ecad4a56f82", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261113T200437857452Z", "elapsed_seconds": 86.031, "completed_utc": "2026-11-13T20:06:03.899959+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "edf2e5a08bd8a44c998e16b47cc26494da5aca5bc46d3b6c023eaa67cdbe56ea", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261113T200437857452Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "485a3a962398c4db4a44b1c199d5c1d7956ec01637f06c60a11422646f9d5e33"}}}
